  "notes": "Before Ha Ha Ha, Trey chided Fish saying, &ldquo;You should know this song, Fish, because you wrote this song.&rdquo; After Ha Ha Ha, Trey said that he loved that song so much, that the time had come for the debut of Party Time, another Fish original that he loves even more. Before Tube, Trey said that he couldn&rsquo;t hear what song a group of fans were shouting for, saying that it sounded like &ldquo;Snoop.&rdquo;&nbsp; Trey then joked, &ldquo;You said &lsquo;Snoop&rsquo;? He&rsquo;s right back here, Snoop Dogg, everyone!&rdquo; Finally, he started Tube, saying that he thought that was the song they were requesting. After Alaska, Trey offered some kind words for his guitar tech, Brian Brown, adding, &ldquo;No Brian, no guitar.&rdquo;",
